## Description

This detection identifies **Registry Value Modification** events recorded by **Microsoft Sysmon Event ID 13**.

The Windows Registry stores critical operating system and application configuration settings. Threat actors frequently modify registry values to establish persistence, disable security controls, hide malware, or alter system behavior.

Monitoring registry modifications provides defenders with visibility into one of the most commonly abused persistence mechanisms on Windows systems.

